<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\グレーチング開ける.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地穴.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"There's a cave under here?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right. We keep the ritual implements and such here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Boo! Someone's been using my secret base without asking!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"This was a storeroom to begin with. We needed someone who would always know if anything was amiss. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's why the children of every generation have used it as their secret base."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Booo! So I was being used!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ハシゴ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\洞窟内川.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Whoa... amazing!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, this is about the only place we haven't searched yet..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
　No, <STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE> probably isn't here..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You can tell?"</STYLE><PG>
"Um, um... 
{PAUSE ""}
Yeah, I've got a good nose."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see. But let's look, just to be safe."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Just as I thought. We've searched this far, and she isn't here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1">, what's wrong, really?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I knew it. <STYLE ID="2">Sis's</STYLE> smell isn't here."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You need the key to get through here, and there was a cave-in once, so it's dangerous. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Your<STYLE ID="1"> nose can't even tell? Then she isn't here... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Let's head back for now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
　Oh, yeah! Let's go, let's go! <STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> already here, right!?"
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
